","source":"Summon shadows from the darkness to aid you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"从黑暗中召唤阴影来协助你战斗。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c44c96cce9a61a74e59a2316de4bd1e60ca1e3ae4edb8a9726fb375ced40739a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"823262b30e17e26a974b262e8286e9565b0fae0db445e833f42c206a897c7911","logical_entry_identity":"f0ae5d5222897a32b98f9659f86c7e4eecdc03c2320d149f3fc62e4c032aba14","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ice","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"寒冰"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3cc4aed9dcf27f469563d41a9f3ac22092cf917d75792c00f45a1b1ce135981b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"823374b3bfed670264e4f99f6c51e73ad38733545d65fdff432983761bc6e90b","logical_entry_identity":"d6de950f8a3c85e17abb09cefa1950b65a0ec94941f98fe0b64302e3d4443491","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You surround yourself with a radius %d distortion of gravity, knocking back and dealing %0.2f physical damage to all creatures inside it.  The effect lasts %d turns.  Deals 50%% extra damage to pinned targets, in addition to the knockback.\n\t\tThe blast wave may hit targets more then once, depending on the radius and the knockback effect.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你用 %d 码半径范围的重力扭曲场围绕自己，击退所有单位并造成 %0.2f 物理伤害。此效果持续 %d 回合。除击退效果外，还对定身状态的目标额外造成 50%% 伤害。\n\t\t这股爆炸性冲击波可能会对目标造成多次伤害，这取决于攻击半径和击退效果。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}